  unitName: Frozen Blade Kyle
  unitId: 20424
  unitNumber: 1284
  description: Kyle investigated the past of each convict selected for the Ishgria
    Expeditionary Force, gaining a thorough understanding of their abilities and
    personalities before bringing a plan to his superiors. Judging that the convicts
    were not suited to work together in large numbers, he proposed to dispatch each
    member as an individual scout, covering ground as quickly as possible and minimizing
    the overall risk to the squad. However, as soon as the expeditionary force entered
    Ishgria, the plan was thrown into disarray when they were confronted by a certain
    demon. Kyle had no choice but to split his forces without adequate preparation.
    In the face of extreme danger, only three soldiers made it back to the regrouping
    point.
  summonDesc: Even criminals have their reasons.<br>Justice must be served,<br>but
    do not assume that all criminals are beyond redemption.
  fusionDesc: I receive this power with thanks.<br>I only wish I'd had such power
    during that fateful battle...
  evoDesc: No matter the challenge,<br>we shall overcome!<br>I have faith in my purpose!
  element: 2
  rarity: 4
